SUMMARY:Panigiri of Stavros\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Folegandros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Exaltation of the Cross is kept in Chora on the evening of 13 September with a glenti in Plateia Agiou Nikolaou — food and wine put out by residents\, violin and laouto and the locals' own dancing. September is the sweet spot on Folegandros: warm sea\, empty beaches\, and this is the last feast before the island winds down.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/folegandros/#chora-panigiri-of-stavros-chora
